        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 6:30PM EDT until September 26 at 8:00AM EDT by NWS Wilmington NC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Seas up to 6 ft.

* WHERE...Southeast North Carolina coastal waters, 10 to 20 NM
from shore.

* WHEN...Until 8 AM EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
